### Test Company Deletion API
### This file can be used with REST Client extension in VS Code or IntelliJ

### 1. First, get authentication token (replace with your actual token)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@companyId = YOUR_COMPANY_ID_HERE

### 2. Get list of companies to find a company ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Get company details before deletion
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Delete the company
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Verify company is deleted (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Verify all related entities are deleted
### Check workspaces (should be empty or not exist)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/workspaces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Check company members (should be empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/companies/{{companyId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


